	</entry>
	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  pl/sql boucle qui continue]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=3890#p3890"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Cette instruction n&#039;est pas correcte :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>select count(*) as trigger_existe from information_schema.triggers where trigger_schema != &#039;pg_catalog&#039;
    and trigger_schema = v_name_schema</code></pre></div><p>Ça devrait être :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>select into trigger_existe count(*) from information_schema.triggers where trigger_schema != &#039;pg_catalog&#039;
    and trigger_schema = v_name_schema</code></pre></div><p>Attention à bien déclarer trigger_existe avant.</p>]]></content>
